;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Phew, good grief, an incident like that, here in Motoki-cho... 
{PAUSE ""}
Its only merits were peace and cherry blossoms, too. What's the world coming to."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good work today, </STYLE>Assistant Inspector <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いせ">Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Oh, good work. 
{PAUSE ""}
I heard <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-san's daughter</STYLE> is here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, we had her identify the body a little while ago, and now she's waiting for her mother, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Akane-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, to finish being questioned."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You had her look at the body? Didn't <STYLE ID="3">the daughter</STYLE> object?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"We didn't actively encourage it, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">she said she wanted to face it properly."</STYLE><PG>
"A levelheaded <STYLE ID="3">daughter</STYLE>. Did you go to the house to get her?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, and two friends came along with her then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Friends? Did you get their names?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, 17, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erina Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, 15."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚きバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Wh...!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"N-no, it's nothing... 
{PAUSE ""}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE>, huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Something bothering you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"No, just a little something. 
{PAUSE ""}
A long time ago, I heard a worrying rumor from a senior of mine."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a delinquent girl?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's not like that, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, I'll look into this myself. 
{PAUSE ""}
And... 
{PAUSE ""}
did you say <STYLE ID="6">Erina Goto</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, she's petite and didn't look at all like a high school student, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I see... damn it, I missed out."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Missed out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚きバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"No no no no no no! It's nothing! It's nothing at all!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"But, <STYLE ID="6">Erina Goto</STYLE>―they call her a genius girl, don't they. 
{PAUSE ""}
I hope she doesn't get any funny ideas..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Funny ideas like what?"</STYLE><PG>
"She's friends with <STYLE ID="3">the Kogori daughter</STYLE>, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　I mean, I hope she doesn't get the stupid idea of catching the culprit <STYLE ID="6">herself</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, that's true... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, </STYLE>Assistant Inspector <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いせ">Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you knew </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is called a genius girl. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">You're awfully well-informed, or, how should I put it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚きバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Don't talk n-n-n-n-n-nonsense!
{PAUSE ""}
　This police officer, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="いせだいじろう">Daijiro Ise</STYLE>, would never think of anything so indecent!
{PAUSE ""}
　Absolutely never!
{PAUSE ""}
　Young girls are to be adored, and laying a hand on them is out of the question!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... what are you talking about?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I told you, it's nothing!
{PAUSE ""}
　I have to look into <STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE>! I'm busy!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Assistant Inspector <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いせ">Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the records room is the other way?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I-I-I know that! I just strayed from the path a little!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Aah... </STYLE>Assistant Inspector <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="いせ">Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if only his tastes were normal, he'd be popular with women... What a waste."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
